Z||000000||hugh||12-15-2001||08:14 AM||||From the police on this board I would like to know;What speed are you permited to go when not in pursuit?I am always passed by State Troopers on the local expressways  going well over the limit. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||REDHOTT88||12-15-2001||08:27 AM||||It's written in the police handbook...try and persuade other drivers to either go slower than you, say 20 in a 35 mph zone, or try to get them to go as fast as you without realizing they're doing it, then pull them over and give them a ticket!!||||reg||1
Z||000002||ejayerik||12-15-2001||10:19 AM||||Most of the Police I know have just made it a habbit to drive a little faster than normal. If anyone asks, they are on their way to a call. Most of the time they were on their way back to the station at the end of shift. I knew an officer that was pulled over by the California Highway Patrol for speeding in his marked patrol unit!! The Chipie asked why he was speeding and the officer just laughed. Turns out the chipie was new. Boy did he get in trouble. The guy insisted on giving a ticket. That was until his SRG. was called by the officers dispatch. Turns out that the chipies Srg. had been on the local Police force with the officer that was pulled over. The officer was his FTO. (field training officer) and they were good buddys. Needless to say, the CHP Officer was ripped a new one when he decided to start quoting vehicle codes to the Srgt. I think the guy is posted somewhere near the Mexican border now. Gets pretty lonely down there.||||reg||6
Z||000003||avengador1||12-15-2001||12:08 PM||||I once was doing 110 MPH drafting behind a semi on I84 going downhill towards the Taconic state parkway exit in the right lane. I glanced to my left and noticed a N.Y. state trooper in the left lane glaring at me. I put the brakes on and he took off. I guess he figured I got his message. He got off at the exit for the Taconic state parkway where the state trooper barracks are. I guess he was at the end of his shift and didn't want the extra paperwork. Lucky me. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
